{
  "feature": "expressions",
  "name": "Mild surprise (natural)",
  "part": {
    "schema": "xfs/expression-part-1",
    "body": {
      "label": "Mildly surprised",
      "controls": {
        "eye_l_brows_raise_in": 0.45,
        "eye_l_brows_raise_out": 0.4,
        "eye_l_widen": 0.35,
        "eye_r_brows_raise_in": 0.4,
        "eye_r_brows_raise_out": 0.45,
        "eye_r_widen": 0.32,
        "jaw_mid_open": 0.14,
        "lips_apart_dn": 0.22,
        "lips_apart_up": 0.12
      },
      "links": {
        "eye_brows_raise_in": false,
        "eye_brows_raise_out": false,
        "eye_widen": false
      },
      "origin": {
        "kind": "rest"
      }
    }
  },
  "facs": {
    "closestVanilla": "facial_surprised",
    "actionUnits": [
      {
        "au": "AU1",
        "name": "Inner brow raiser",
        "intensity": "C",
        "controls": [
          "eye_l_brows_raise_in",
          "eye_r_brows_raise_in"
        ]
      },
      {
        "au": "AU2",
        "name": "Outer brow raiser",
        "intensity": "B",
        "controls": [
          "eye_l_brows_raise_out",
          "eye_r_brows_raise_out"
        ]
      },
      {
        "au": "AU5",
        "name": "Upper lid raiser",
        "intensity": "B",
        "controls": [
          "eye_l_widen",
          "eye_r_widen"
        ]
      },
      {
        "au": "AU25+26",
        "name": "Lips part, jaw drop",
        "intensity": "B",
        "controls": [
          "lips_apart_up",
          "lips_apart_dn",
          "jaw_mid_open"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "why": [
      "The classic surprise prototype (AU1 + AU2 + AU5 + AU26) at low intensity: both brows lift evenly, the eyes open a little wider, the jaw drops a few millimetres.",
      "No other action units compete. The vanilla face mixes in cheek suck, lip purse and funnel, throat open and a jaw shift, and opens one eye much wider than the other."
    ],
    "source": "XF Studio experiment 026 (research/animation/natural-expressions.md): authored values, tuned in the live preview."
  }
}
